# Git commits — no Cursor co-author

- NEVER add `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>` (or any Cursor co-author trailer) to commit messages.
- NEVER append co-author trailers unless the user explicitly names a human co-author.
- Keep commit messages to the usual short subject + optional body only.
